in the definition of $\phi$ in the quasi-static normalisation used above,
so that with the $c_{kk}=1$ convention the control parameter is the
positive ratio $|\rho|/\phi\mu$, $\kappa=-\rho/\phi\mu$.  This is the
conventional $ \kappa_{0}=1+\rho/\phi\mu$ form once the $+1$ self term is
absorbed. ∎

